{"id":"8aa591103dfc304a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-woodin-embed.md","title":"Woodin Embedding Theorem","display":"thm-woodin-embed — Woodin Embedding Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-woodin-embed","aliases":["58-thm-woodin-embed"],"display":"thm-woodin-embed — Woodin Embedding Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-woodin-embed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-woodin-embed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-woodin-embed — Woodin Embedding Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is the metalinguistic collection of classes.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the class-level witness scheme from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}embed}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}embed}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是上游 Woodin 定义的消去方向；强嵌入、临界点、传递类目标以及对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\)</span> 的保持条件由精确的类层见证谓词展开。</li>\n<li>Woodin cardinals have embeddings witnessing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strength for each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Used in the construction of derived models.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md","status":"resolved","id":"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md","status":"resolved","id":"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}$ is the class-level witness scheme from [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}embed}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\to\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":1247,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4492","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-woodin-embed.md|58-thm-woodin-embed]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["da3159c0c219916e","f9019f8b9c0a2aa1"]}